"such as a JPEG compression mosaic.<br><b>Reduce Texturing</b>: reduce image "
"artifacts, such as paper texture, or Moire patterns on scanned images."
"<br><b>Custom</b>: Puts settings to most common values, fully customizable.</"
"p>"
