#: core/dplugins/generic/tools/mjpegstream/mjpegstreamdlg_views.cpp:80
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The %1 server allows to share items through the local network using a web "
"browser. Motion JPEG is a video compression format in which each video frame "
"is compressed separately as a JPEG image. MJPEG stream is a standard which "
"allows network clients to be connected without additional module. Most major "
"web browsers and players support MJPEG stream. To access the stream from "
"your browser, just use http://address:port as url, with address the MJPEG "
"server IP, and port the server port set in this config dialog."
msgstr ""
"„%1“ serveris ļauj koplietot vienumus lokālajā tīklā, izmantojot tīmekļa "
"pārlūkprogrammu. „Motion JPEG“ ir video kompresijas formāts, kurā katrs "
"video kadrs tiek saspiests kā JPEG attēls. MJPEG plūsma ir standarts, kas "
"ļauj tīkla klientiem savienoties bez papildu moduļa. MPJEG plūsmas atbalsta "
"lielākā daļa populārāko tīmekļa pārlūkprogrammu. Lai piekļūtu plūsmai no "
"pārlūkprogrammas, vienkārši adreses joslā rakstiet http://adrese:ports, kur "
"adreses vietā norādiet MJPEG servera IP adrese, bet porta vietā servera "
"portu, kas norādīts šajā konfigurācijas lodziņā."

