#: core/libs/database/utils/widgets/dbsettingswidget.cpp:117
#, fuzzy, kde-format
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>Set here the location where the database files will be stored on your "
#| "system. There are four databases: one for all collections properties, one "
#| "to store compressed thumbnails, one to store faces recognition metadata, "
#| "and one to store similarity fingerprints.<br>Write access is required to "
#| "be able to edit image properties.</p><p>Databases are digiKam core "
#| "engines. Take care to use a place hosted by fast hardware (eg. SSD or "
#| "NVMe) with enough free space especially for thumbnails database.</"
#| "p><p>Note: a remote file system such as NFS, cannot be used here. For "
#| "performance reasons, it is also recommended not to use network storage "
#| "media.</p><p></p>"
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"<p>Set here the location where the database files will be stored on your "
"system. There are four databases: one for all collections properties, one to "
"store compressed thumbnails, one to store faces recognition metadata, and "
"one to store similarity fingerprints.<br>Write access is required to be able "
"to edit image properties.</p><p>Databases are digiKam core engines. Take "
"care to use a place hosted by fast hardware (eg. SSD or NVMe) with enough "
"free space especially for thumbnails database.</p><p>Note: a remote file "
"system such as NFS, cannot be used here. For performance reasons, it is also "
"recommended not to use network storage media.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Norādiet te vietu, kurā jūsu sistēmā glabāsies datubāzes datnes. Pastāv "
"četras datubāzes: viena visu kolekciju īpašībām, viena saspiestu sīktēlu "
"glabāšanai, viena seju atpazīšanas metadatiem un viens līdzības digitālajiem "
"nospiedumiem.<br>Lai rediģētu attēla īpašības, nepieciešama rakstīšanas "
"piekļuve.</p><p>Datubāzes ir „digiKam“ galvenais dzinējspēks. Parūpējieties, "
"ka tās atrodas uz ātras aparatūras (piemēram, SSD vai NVMe) ar pietiekoši "
"daudz vietu, kas īpaši svarīgi ir sīktēlu datubāzei.</p><p>Ievērībai: šim "
"nolūkam nevar izmantot attālu datņu sistēmu, piemēram, NFS. Veiktspējas dēļ "
"ieteicams neizmantot tīkla datu nesējus.</p><p></p>"

