"database.<br>If your database is not already set up, you can use the "
"following SQL commands (after replacing the <b><i>password</i></b> with the "
"correct one).</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>„digiKam“ sagaida, ka datubāze jau būs izveidota ar speciālu lietotāja "
"kontu. Šim lietotājvārdam <i>digikam</i> būs nepieciešama pilna piekļuve "
"datubāzei.<br>Ja datubāze vēl nav sagatavota, varat izmantot šī SQL komandas "
"(bet aizvietojiet <b><i>parole</i></b> ar pareizo paroli).</p>"

#: core/libs/database/utils/widgets/dbsettingswidget.cpp:341
#, fuzzy, kde-format
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>Note: with a Linux server, a database can be initialized following the "
#| "commands below:</p><p># su</p><p># systemctl restart mysqld</p><p># mysql "
#| "-u root</p><p>...</p><p>Enter SQL code to Mysql prompt in order to init "
#| "digiKam databases with grant privileges (see behind)</p><p>...</"
#| "p><p>quit</p><p>NOTE: If you have problems with a MySQL server on Ubuntu "
#| "based Linux system, use the addition command in the mysql prompt to be "
#| "able to create MySQL triggers.<br>SET GLOBAL "
#| "log_bin_trust_function_creators=1;</p><p>NOTE: If you have an enormous "
#| "collection, you should start MySQL server with mysql --"
#| "max_allowed_packet=128M OR in my.ini or ~/.my.cnf, change the settings</p>"
msgid ""
"<p>Note: with a Linux server, a database can be initialized following the "
"commands below:</p><p># su</p><p># systemctl restart mariadbd</p><p># "
"mariadb -u root</p><p>...</p><p>Enter SQL code to MariaDB prompt in order to "
"init digiKam databases with grant privileges (see behind)</p><p>...</"
"p><p>quit</p><p>NOTE: If you have problems with a MariaDB server on Ubuntu "
"based Linux system, use the addition command in the MariaDB prompt to be "
"able to create MariaDB triggers.<br>SET GLOBAL "
"log_bin_trust_function_creators=1;</p><p>NOTE: If you have an enormous "
"collection, you should start MariaDB server with mariadb --"
"max_allowed_packet=128M OR in my.ini or ~/.my.cnf, change the settings</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Ievērībai: „Linux“ serverī datubāzi iespējams inicializēt ar šīm komandām:"
"</p><p># su</p><p># systemctl restart mysqld</p><p># mysql -u root</p><p>..."
"</p><p>Lai inicializētu „digiKam“ datubāzes ar nepieciešamajām lietošanas "
"tiesībām, „Mysql“ uzvednē ievadiet SQL kodu (skatīt iepriekš)</p><p>...</"
"p><p>quit</p><p>IEVĒRĪBAI: ja rodas problēmas ar „MySQL“ serveri uz „Linux“ "
"distributīva, kas ir balstīts uz „Ubuntu“, lai izveidotu „MySQL“ trigerus, "
"„mysql“ uzvednē rakstiet papildu komandas.<br>SET GLOBAL "
"log_bin_trust_function_creators=1;</p><p>IEVĒRĪBAI: ja jums ir milzīga "
"vienumu kolekcija, jums jāpalaiž „MySQL“ serveris ar „mysql --"
"max_allowed_packet=128M“ VAI datnē „my.ini“ vai (~/.my.cnf) jānomaina "
"iestatījumi</p>"

#: core/libs/database/utils/widgets/dbsettingswidget.cpp:365
#, kde-format
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Prasības"

#: core/libs/database/utils/widgets/dbsettingswidget.cpp:369
#, kde-format
msgid "Database Server Technical Details"
msgstr "Datubāzes servera tehniskā informācija"

#: core/libs/database/utils/widgets/dbsettingswidget.cpp:371
#, fuzzy, kde-format
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>Use this configuration view to set all information to be connected to "
#| "a remote <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MySQL\">Mysql database "
#| "server</a> (or <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MariaDB\">MariaDB</"
#| "a>) through a network. As with Sqlite or MySQL internal server, 3 "
#| "databases will be stored on the remote server: one for all collections "
#| "properties, one to store compressed thumbnails, and one to store faces "
#| "recognition metadata.</p><p>Unlike Sqlite or MySQL internal server, you "
#| "can customize the database names to simplify your backups.</"
#| "p><p>Databases are digiKam core engines. To prevent performance issues, "
#| "take a care to use a fast network link between the client and the server "
#| "computers. It is also recommended to host database files on fast hardware "
#| "(as <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solid-state_drive\">SSD</a>) "
#| "with enough free space, especially for thumbnails database, even if data "
#| "are compressed using wavelets image format <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia."
#| "org/wiki/Progressive_Graphics_File\">PGF</a>.</p><p>The databases must be "
#| "created previously on the remote server by the administrator. Look in "
#| "<b>Requirements</b> tab for details.</p>"
msgid ""
"<p>Use this configuration view to set all information to be connected to a "
"remote <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MariaDB\">MariaDB</a> through "
"a network. As with Sqlite or MariaDB internal server, 3 databases will be "
"stored on the remote server: one for all collections properties, one to "
"store compressed thumbnails, and one to store faces recognition metadata.</"
"p><p>Unlike Sqlite or MariaDB internal server, you can customize the "
"database names to simplify your backups.</p><p>Databases are digiKam core "
"engines. To prevent performance issues, take a care to use a fast network "
"link between the client and the server computers. It is also recommended to "
"host database files on fast hardware (as <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Solid-state_drive\">SSD</a>) with enough free space, especially for "
"thumbnails database, even if data are compressed using wavelets image format "
"<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Progressive_Graphics_File\">PGF</a>."
"</p><p>The databases must be created previously on the remote server by the "
"administrator. Look in <b>Requirements</b> tab for details.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Lai iestatītu visu informāciju, kas nepieciešama savienojumam datortīklā "
"ar attālu <a href=\"https://lv.wikipedia.org/wiki/MySQL\">„Mysql“ datubāzes "
"serveri</a>, lietojiet šo konfigurāciju (vai <a href=\"https://lv.wikipedia."
"org/wiki/MariaDB\">„MariaDB“</a>). Līdzīgi tam, kā tas ir ar „Sqlite“ un "
"„MySQL“ iekšējiem serveriem, attālā serverī tiks saglabātas trīs datubāzes: "
"viena visu kolekciju īpašībām, viena saspiestu sīktēlu glabāšanai un viena "
"seju atpazīšanas metadatiem.</p><p>Atšķirībā no „Sqlite“ un „MySQL“ iekšējā "
"servera, varat pielāgot datubāzes nosaukumus, tā vienkāršojot rezerves "
"kopiju veidošanu.</p><p>Datubāzes ir „digiKam“ galvenais dzinējspēks. Lai "
"novērstu veiktspējas problēmas, starp servera un klienta datoriem "
"nodrošiniet ātru tīkla savienojumu. Tāpat ieteicams datubāzes datnes mitināt "
"uz ātras aparatūras (piemēram, <a href=\"https://lv.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Pusvadītāju_disks\">SSD</a>) ar pietiekami daudz vietas, īpaši sīktēlu "
"datubāzei, pat tad, ja dati tiek saspiesti, izmantojot maiņviļņu attēlu "
"formātu <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Progressive_Graphics_File"
"\">PGF</a>.</p><p>Datubāze administratoram ir jāizveido jau iepriekš uz "
"attālā servera. Vairāk varat uzzināt cilnē <b>Prasības</b>.</p>"

