"\"Neon\": coloring the edges in a photograph to\n"
"reproduce a fluorescent light effect.\n"
"\"Find Edges\": detects the edges in a photograph\n"
"and their strength.\n"
"\"Lut3D\": coloring images with Lut3D filters"
